        {
          "text": " Ka yes da, kocoito noi kosaca ibore yenitateleoritai kinyeis naidauniata aitaleor, ayaŋaar ibore yenitateleoritai; kosodete kwaŋin ayaun aiken oidukurun luka Isirael ka aitican kes. ",
