              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema Yosua ituŋa luarei luarosete akwap ebe, “Koloto togo loka naadote, kitolomut aberu, ka luejaatar kere, kwape kiyapoikinioto ŋes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.22",
